Package: bulkMAE
Type: Package
Title: Stateless Bulk Transcriptomics with MultiAssayExperiment
Version: 0.4.0
Authors@R: c(
    person(
      given = "bulkMAE",
      family = "Developers",
      role = c("aut", "cre"),
      email = "maintainer@example.org"
    )
  )
Description: Provides small, stateless adapters from MultiAssayExperiment
    objects with SummarizedExperiment leaves to established bulk
    transcriptomics methods. The package standardizes data access, identifier
    validation, and sample alignment while leaving statistical modelling and
    result classes to their native backend packages.
biocViews: RNASeq, GeneExpression, DifferentialExpression, DifferentialSplicing,
    GeneSetEnrichment, NetworkInference, Clustering, TimeCourse,
    Classification, Survival
